# Agent protocol (mandatory)

Do **not** wait for the user to ask. At the **start of every task**, before editing code:

1. **Read** `.specify/memory/constitution.md` (hard rules override defaults).
2. **Read** `.agents/skills/anrotrip/SKILL.md` — if missing, run `pnpm skills:install` and read again.
3. **Skim** `AGENTS.md` and, if present locally, `.doc/README.md`; open only docs relevant to the task (see `01-docs-routing.mdc`, `02-skills-routing.mdc`). `.doc/` is not in git.

## When to read more

| Situation | Action |
|-----------|--------|
| First time in session / broad task | Read `.doc/audits/AUDIT-PLAN-STATUS.md` |
| Touching `src/` | Read `.doc/architecture/architecture-reference.md` |
| Unclear scope | Read `.doc/roadmaps/project-roadmap.md` |

## Constraints (never skip)

- `Header.astro` — frozen unless user explicitly requests changes.
- `vite.build.cssMinify: false` — do not change (production blur).
- No `<!-- HTML comments -->` inside JSX `{...}` blocks (Prettier/lefthook).
- NAP / phones / offices — only `src/data/company.ts`.
- Before commit: `pnpm check`.

## Skills install

External skills: `.agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` (from `skills-lock.json`).  
Workflow: `.cursor/skills/aif-*/SKILL.md`. Catalog: `.doc/meta/skills-primary-shortlists.md`.
